# 换行符统一为 LF：仓库内与检出后都强制 LF，
# 与 .editorconfig / .prettierrc.json 的 endOfLine: lf 保持一致，
# 防止 Windows 的 core.autocrlf=true 检出成 CRLF 后 pnpm format:check 大面积报红。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd 无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止任何换行符 /编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
